      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} Ok, so I have pinned this down further! It is tied to framerate. If I lock my FPS to 60, it is fine with no stuttering, but if I uncap the FPS, they stutter. So most likely their position is updating at 60fps or some value lower than my max fps which makes it look like they are stuttering. And this is why is it really only noticeable at high speeds. I hope this helps!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
